{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_06_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_06","title":"殺手女皇","storyCode":"OF-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ce0c91c66639e0519ad94a732e4bcff0cdda039f9c7bd0cacccfc06eb51d0b5f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"大家！！準備好了吧！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"黑曜石節最盛大的聯合LIVE將在3小時後開始！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦哦哦哦哦！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"時間差不多了。只要黑能和羅德島相互牽制，這裡也就一切順利了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"讓羅德島和黑對立果然是步好棋，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"快點！把這些東西給我搬走！動作不夠快的話，你們的薪水也要打水漂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？外面什麼聲音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，如果單純的只是衝進廣播塔，肯定會遭到克洛寧的埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們和我一起行動，黑一定會先想辦法解除各位的武裝，那樣我就更沒有辦法牽制她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"就算粗暴地奪得了廣播塔的控制權，如果沒有政府的支持，我的話只會讓市民陷入迷惑和恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"如果黑保護著克洛寧，這對於各位的行動來說，也是很大的阻礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是，克洛寧到底隱藏著什麼，這可能需要各位去發掘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"也許克洛寧真的是個像紙面一樣清白的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就會挾持他，逼他發出官方公告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"對。如果真的是這樣的話，我也不會介意去這麼做，畢竟我確實是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭小姐，你很有膽識，但是甚至可以說有些冒險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗的資料和調查報告，羅德島的各位已經幫我證實了，如果不這麼做，汐斯塔的所有人都會遭殃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不是要指責你什麼，小姐。只是羅德島的參與與否，並非由我決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。前因後果你都已經很清楚了。我們該怎麼做？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"都到這一步了，必須做些什麼！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"讓無辜的人受難，這違背了羅德島的信條。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，責任由誰承擔？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"只要沒人發現，就沒有人參與過！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭小姐，事不宜遲，我們啟程吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"做你該做的事吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，就由我去牽制黑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也有不得不去做的事情，我必須知道答案......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"黑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要疏遠我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐是在維多利亞經受過良好教育的人。你應該去更好的地方，別和我們這樣的人一起留在這個城市掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"......不對。這一點也不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"黑，你在我心裡是什麼樣的人？我在你心裡又是什麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是小姐看到的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你殺過人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你殺過很多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小姐。別再說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"可能我們都弄錯了，黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我不想你知道這些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經知道了。我知道了你的過去......哪怕只是一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"如果黑不願意我知道，對不起，我沒辦法說“我不知道”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小姐！你根本不應該知道！你本應該......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該什麼？應該這樣，應該那樣，應該好好讀書，應該躋身名流，什麼呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是什麼溫室裡的花，也不是什麼不諳世事的大小姐了！我知道我有必須要做的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"保護汐斯塔，既是父親的事情，是你的事情，也是我的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想我捲入這種事情，是為了保護我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我不......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你和爸爸都一樣，你們覺得你們這樣安排我會過得很好，但我不覺得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我不覺得危險有什麼，我不覺得黑的過去有什麼！也許真正在經歷這些的時候，我也會哭，也會悲傷，也會覺得可怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，只要黑說，“需要錫蘭來幫助我”的話，我一定會來的！無論你說什麼，我都會聽的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是朋友的話，就應該是這樣啊，一直都僅僅是單方面地付出的話，算什麼朋友啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，黑，現在可以來幫我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經問過我，為什麼要這樣做？我已經回答過了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你可不可以也給我一個答案，黑？如果過去的都過去了，你可以再當一次我的朋友嗎，就像小時候那樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐......對不起。我為過去我的言行向你道歉。我的所作所為讓你誤解了，這些都不該發生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你是我的朋友，一直都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，你們絮叨這麼久，然後呢，結論呢？怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，請說，你接下來的安排是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我......嗯......我想透過官方途徑發送真實的災害報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"現在羅德島應該在搜集克洛寧的罪證，很快就能把他踢出市政廳機關......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"但災害報告發佈以後，黑曜石節可能要取消，汐斯塔也必須遷移，我怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"如果小姐這麼想的話，我支持小姐這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你需要我保護你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"那就請小姐躲好了。很快就會結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"黑，你在做什麼？你是要背叛命令嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"命令？協助克洛寧？一層偽裝而已。自始至終，我只接到過兩個命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，老爺要我徹查克洛寧的罪證，包括關於他暗中控制V3工業公司，私自開採黑曜石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"現在一切都明晰了，沒什麼好說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快動手！快把她們兩個都抓了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"第二個命令你們也已經聽見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"——小姐要我保護她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["赫拉格"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
